        d.p('Jalour has stated that it will cover project funding gaps, including those caused by timing differences in collections, from its cash reserves and from cash generated by other projects it is constructing. The form, amount and conditions of that undertaking are to be documented. It is a commitment to fund the projects, not a guarantee of the investor\'s return. Jalour\'s capacity therefore rests on its own cash reserves and on distributions from those other projects, which are subject to those projects\' own agreements and progress and are not held for these projects. Jalour\'s audited accounts and track record are provided after the investor signs the non-disclosure agreement.')
